  "summary": "LS5 454 big-block crankcase ventilation (PCV): the hose and connector from the valve cover to the air cleaner, PCV hose and grommets, the oil-fill/breather plug, the air cleaner ID and horsepower stickers, and the exhaust-manifold studs. Hose [8] is clamped with clamps [7] (two torque values), plug [9] is torqued into the intake, and the LH/RH manifold studs [10]/[11] are driven to a set protrusion height rather than a torque. Air cleaner, flame arrestor, wing nut, PCV valve and the hose clamps marked [A] are production (non-RPO) parts.",
